        "path_description": "Two connected legs forming an L-shape: Leg 1 (north-to-south): Ngaru-Bon plateau → Lam-Chen Pass → Kheshkai steppe (metals southbound, horses/tin northbound). Leg 2 (northeast-to-southwest): Kheshkai steppe → Breath-of-Cloud border → Qollari highlands (horses/furs southwestbound, dyes/wool northeastbound)",
        "commodities": "Metals, horses, furs, amber, tin, dyes, fine wool. Not a single east-west flow but two bilateral exchanges pivoting through Kheshkai",
        "bottleneck": "Kheshkai clan-lords (grazing rights at waystations on both legs)",
        "consequence_if_closed": "Ngaru-Bon loses its overland iron market. Qollari loses horse supply and steppe amber. A clan feud can close 300 leagues for a year",
